      "note": "libsspi bundles MIT Kerberos / GSSAPI (SSPI on Linux): its network imports are Kerberos's; '4.3.2.26' is an OID fragment. Full capa (22 MB): the night scan. Content review only."
     }
    ],
    "note": "Windows amd64 wheel of the reviewed version: the Linux wheel's members, without sspilib.libs/libsspi (the bundled Kerberos/GSSAPI shim): on Windows the 9 Cython .pyd call the system's SSPI (Secur32.dll; capa: encrypt/decrypt via SSPI, plus CRT start-up code), no other library. Python identical, METADATA CRLF only. No new finding or YARA hit, no .pth, no hook, no network/process imports. Attestation verifies, same publisher (jborean93/sspilib ci.yml)."
   },
